WEBVTT

00:00:09.310 --> 00:00:12.370
Look at the sky! Look! It's a plane!

00:00:12.370 --> 00:00:13.990
Superman!

00:00:49.290 --> 00:00:55.530
Faster than a speeding bullet, more powerful than a locomotive, able to leap tall buildings

00:00:55.530 --> 00:01:00.000
at a single bound, this amazing stranger from the planet Krypton, the man

00:01:00.440 --> 00:01:08.820
Superman. Possessing remarkable physical strength, Superman fights a never-ending

00:01:08.820 --> 00:01:28.870
battle for truth and justice. Disguised as a mild-mannered newspaper reporter, Clark Kent.

00:02:35.080 --> 00:02:38.550
And I still say Manhattan rightfully belongs to my people.

00:02:38.550 --> 00:02:41.450
Possibly, but just what do you expect us to do about it?

00:02:41.450 --> 00:02:43.020
You have a newspaper?

00:02:43.020 --> 00:02:44.310
Publish the truth.

00:02:44.310 --> 00:02:46.800
Have the island vacated immediately.

00:02:46.800 --> 00:02:48.120
It's fantastic.

00:02:48.120 --> 00:02:50.060
Why, that's ridiculous.

00:02:50.060 --> 00:02:51.670
Ridiculous?

00:02:51.670 --> 00:02:54.930
Maybe modern science will make you think differently.

00:02:54.930 --> 00:02:57.080
.

00:03:00.830 --> 00:03:03.230
i've never heard anything so absurd

00:03:03.230 --> 00:03:06.530
you know from the look in his eyes i'd almost believe he was an earnest

00:03:06.530 --> 00:03:11.560
no he's just a harmless crank

00:03:37.800 --> 00:03:42.290
Come ahead, Miss Lane. You wouldn't want to miss this story, I'm sure.

00:04:00.410 --> 00:04:19.140
...mationary measure...

00:05:09.400 --> 00:05:12.900
Well, Miss Lane, get ready for the greatest story of your career.

00:05:37.450 --> 00:05:39.320
Come on, Kent. Let's get out of here.

00:05:39.320 --> 00:05:49.360
Looks like a job for Superman.

00:07:02.140 --> 00:07:02.920
Thank you.

00:07:32.170 --> 00:07:40.340
Uh, uh, a girl is still down there.

00:08:00.640 --> 00:08:30.000
Of course, the old island looks

00:08:30.000 --> 00:08:37.040
just as good as ever. That's right, Clark. Thanks to Superman.
